<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period April 21-27 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		Apr 21-27   April 22-28     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    313,618.0   341,362.8</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0 1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  18,090.9    11,907.6   949,803.4    782,237.7</p>
<p> Home Market	  201.7	 313.6    13,998.4     15,977.7</p>
<p> Stocks/close   295,325.4   329,141.6</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
